{"id": "1549819677935411221", "channel_id": "1541375063792549918", "author_id": "372492417783300097", "author_name": "azaenya", "content": "So, lets take Ellie's run as the maximum of 5000 possible affinity points per run. To emphasize, this was only achieveable by stalling as long as possible, (a deeply unfun way to play), on the train event's hardest difficulty, and with a support affinity-farming Gramona.\n\nNow, in order to reach affinity 10, you need 4500 points. That seems theoretically  achieveable in one run, but Ellie had fully built units, so i just want to temper any hopes newer players might have. Theoretically achieveable, but unrealistic to do so out of the gate.\n\nMoving on, the affinity needed doubles to aff 11, with aff 15, you need 42000 points.\n\nAff 20 requires 168000 total.\n\nIn order to reach affinity level 20 from level 1, you need to do Madness Train stall runs 34 times. If you are doing it from affinity 10-20, you are going to do it 33 times. If you are doing it from 15-20, you need to do it 25.2 times. \n\nAnd ALL this, you can only focus on 3 units at a time, you need to have chaos in your team building, you fit gramona in that team, and you cant use auto battle.", "timestamp": "2026-09-16T16:30:05.477000+00:00", "thread_id": "1541375063792549918", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-16T16:34:20.182000+00:00", "thread_title": "Impact of Version 2.6 Affinity Changes on Player Experience", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542484013652910141"]}
{"id": "1549823391274500250", "channel_id": "1541375063792549918", "author_id": "372492417783300097", "author_name": "azaenya", "content": "Now, IF you dare to not use support or ramona, then your total drops to 2000.\n\nThat means, to reach aff 20 from 1, you need spend hours of your time to stall the hardest difficulty in Rail 84 times.\n\n**84 times.**", "timestamp": "2026-09-16T16:44:50.806000+00:00", "thread_id": "1541375063792549918", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Ramona_tuff_", "emoji_id": "1441426630420467753", "count": 4}], "thread_title": "Impact of Version 2.6 Affinity Changes on Player Experience", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542484013652910141"]}
